Kentucky QSO Party in-state received locations
120 counties plus 49 other states plus DC plus 13 provinces plus KY: 184.
KY stations must send county. The class adds KY state credit on a county QSO (issue 317).
The Ky line below has a display name and NO alias, so it is on the multiplier list
but KY can never be received instead of a county.
DX is points only, parsed separately, with no multiplier entry.

INCLUDE FILE kentucky_cty.dom
Ky = ^Kentucky
